      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Data Source\nA `data` block reads an object that Terraform\ndoes not manage. Terraform never changes that\nobject. Terraform reads it during the plan,\nunless the block depends on a value that only\nthe apply can know ([data sources](https://dev\neloper.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/data-s\nources)). This example comes from the\nSnowflake provider's docs ([`snowflake_warehou\nses`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/\nsnowflakedb/snowflake/latest/docs/data-sources\n/warehouses)):\n\n```hcl\ndata \"snowflake_warehouses\" \"like_prefix\" {\nlike = \"prefix%\"\n}\n```\n\nOther blocks read the result as `data.snowflak\ne_warehouses.like_prefix.warehouses`. A data\nsource suits an object that another team,\nanother tool or another state owns.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-aafc847bbd43",
      "originalText": "Data Source\nA `data` block reads an object that Terraform does not manage. Terraform never changes that object. Terraform reads it during the plan, unless the block depends on a value that only the apply can know ([data sources](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/data-sources)). This example comes from the Snowflake provider's docs ([`snowflake_warehouses`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/snowflakedb/snowflake/latest/docs/data-sources/warehouses)):\n\n```hcl\ndata \"snowflake_warehouses\" \"like_prefix\" {\n  like = \"prefix%\"\n}\n```\n\nOther blocks read the result as `data.snowflake_warehouses.like_prefix.warehouses`. A data source suits an object that another team, another tool or another state owns.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "data-source"
      }
    },
