    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5507571481,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-91f7470b1fd8",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1919.2,
      "y": 1940.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 262.5,
      "seed": 678817,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "State Holds Secrets\nThe state file and saved plan files hold\nattribute values in plain text. That includes\npasswords and keys that the configuration\ngives to a resource ([manage sensitive data](h\nttps://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/langu\nage/manage-sensitive-data)). `sensitive =\ntrue` hides a value only in the output. Keep\nthe state in a backend with access control,\nand never commit it to Git ([.gitignore advice\n](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/la\nnguage/style#gitignore)). A variable with\n`ephemeral = true` stays out of state and plan\nfiles, with some limits on where you can use\nit.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-91f7470b1fd8",
      "originalText": "State Holds Secrets\nThe state file and saved plan files hold attribute values in plain text. That includes passwords and keys that the configuration gives to a resource ([manage sensitive data](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/manage-sensitive-data)). `sensitive = true` hides a value only in the output. Keep the state in a backend with access control, and never commit it to Git ([.gitignore advice](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/style#gitignore)). A variable with `ephemeral = true` stays out of state and plan files, with some limits on where you can use it.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "state-holds-secrets"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5361787809,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-62fdfbd55d19",
