        "node_id": "moved-block"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7763839838,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-2d8b0709a4fd",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1919.2,
      "y": 2460.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 367.5,
      "seed": 553152,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Moved Block\nBy default, Terraform reads a changed address\nas a delete at the old address and a create at\nthe new address ([refactoring](https://develop\ner.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/modules/de\nvelop/refactoring)). So a new local name, or a\nmove into a module, would drop the object and\ncreate a new one. A `moved` block tells\nTerraform that the object now has a new\naddress:\n\n```hcl\nmoved {\nfrom = snowflake_warehouse.transform\nto   = module.warehouses.snowflake_warehouse.t\nransform\n}\n```\n\nThe next plan then changes only the address in\nthe state. The real object stays as it is.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-2d8b0709a4fd",
      "originalText": "Moved Block\nBy default, Terraform reads a changed address as a delete at the old address and a create at the new address ([refactoring](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/modules/develop/refactoring)). So a new local name, or a move into a module, would drop the object and create a new one. A `moved` block tells Terraform that the object now has a new address:\n\n```hcl\nmoved {\n  from = snowflake_warehouse.transform\n  to   = module.warehouses.snowflake_warehouse.transform\n}\n```\n\nThe next plan then changes only the address in the state. The real object stays as it is.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "moved-block"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5508493934,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-754a08ddf8bc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1298.4,
      "y": 2720.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 418.8,
      "height": 220,
      "seed": 106209,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3,
        "value": 8
      },
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "text-754a08ddf8bc"
        },
        {
