      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Data Flow\nOne change flows like this:\n\n`.tf` files and variable values \u2192\n`terraform init` \u2192 `terraform\nplan`, which also reads the state\nand the real objects \u2192 the plan \u2192\n`terraform apply` \u2192 provider API\ncalls \u2192 changed real objects and a\nnew state",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 22.5,
      "containerId": "node-6e42c4fdba11",
      "originalText": "Data Flow\nOne change flows like this:\n\n`.tf` files and variable values \u2192 `terraform init` \u2192 `terraform plan`, which also reads the state and the real objects \u2192 the plan \u2192 `terraform apply` \u2192 provider API calls \u2192 changed real objects and a new state",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "terraform-data-flow"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
